    "blocks": [
      {
        "text": "Q\nAuriam turns her massive head towards you and smiles.  \"You have done a good\ndeed today my friend.  Now I will be able to rest and prepare for the other\ndark warriors that are being sent to fight me.  Please accept this as a\nreward.\"  She gently removes one of her horns and hands it to you saying,\n\"Please use this in the battle against evil, and here take one of my scales\ntoo.\"  She gently removes one of her own armored scales and hands it to you as\nwell.\n~\nR I 16015\nR I 16075\nG I 16013\nG I 16014\nG I 16080\nD\nStretching her powerful golden wings she speaks again.  \"I must go now, I need\nto pray to my god and prepare for my next battle.  I bid good travels to you\nand all your kin.  Remember always that Auriam is your friend.\"  With a mighty\nleap she hurls herself into the air and flies off into the heavens.\n~\n",
        "give": [
