        "text": "Q\nShe smiles and says, \"Thank you!  These skins will help keep me in business\nfor a while longer.  Let me finish stitching this jacket and it will be yours.\"\nShe puts a few more stitches in a bearskin jacket she is working on and hands\nit over.\n~\nR I 16048\nG I 16019\nG I 16019\nG I 16019\n",
