        "disappear": false,
        "line": 124
      },
      {
        "text": "Q\nShe immediately puts aside one of the skins and begins working on the other\nskin she was given.  After a short period of cutting and stitching the skin\nbegins to take form as a fine coat.  As a finishing touch she applies a\nstrange fluid to the fur to make it bright and healthy looking.  When done\nshe hands the coat to you saying, \"Thank you so much.  Please continue to give\nme any of the skins you come by, I will do my best to make it worth your\nwhile.\"\n~\nR I 16050\nG I 16021\nG I 16021\n",
